.SH DIAGNOSTICS
Command errors print ? and leave the session running. Exit status is 0 if there were no recorded errors, 1 after a command/file error, 2 if the initial working area cannot be established.
.SH BUGS
At most 1024 lines fit in the line table; text must fit in the process bank. Lines and command input are bounded (roughly 250 bytes); use short source lines. Global operations have at most 250 pending selected lines. This is not the full historical command set: use ex(1) for undo, backward search, marks, edit/reload and shell escapes.
